text = "WASD fly    SPACE up    SHIFT hurry    ESC free the mouse

1 vertex snap   2 affine UV   3 colour crush   4 dither
5 resolution    6 smooth      7 scanlines      8 floor cuts
9 CRT (vignette + curve + colour bleed)

get close to the floor and look along it. that is where
perspective correction earns its keep — and where turning
it off is impossible to miss.

turn them off one at a time — the one you miss most is
the one doing the work."
horizontal_alignment = 2
vertical_alignment = 2
